					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Given that it's a Chicago Spirit and Herman Fuller crossover, you basically had my upvote from the start, but biases aside this is a really great story. The anomaly you have here is the kind of idea I wish I'd thought of first, and I love the way you incorporated themes of oppression and defiance in a way that makes perfect sense with the world this is set it.</p> 
				 	]]>
